// Coding Guidelines

const codingGuidelines = `
1. Use proper null safety practices
2. Implement proper error handling (typed exceptions + mapping to user-friendly messages; use Result/Either types where it clearly helps)
3. Follow proper naming conventions
4. Use proper widget composition
5. Implement clear, structured routing (Navigator 2.0 or GoRouter are both acceptable; this project currently uses Navigator)
6. Use proper form validation
7. Follow proper state management with Riverpod (providers, StateNotifier/AsyncValue, etc.)
8. Implement proper dependency injection using Riverpod providers (GetIt is optional, not required)
9. Use proper asset management
10. Follow proper testing practices
`;

